@startuml
'==== Title ====
title "As a User, I want to use a Web UI to register a new publication \nin the system and add the publication to my library." - SSD

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox
autonumber

' ==== Actor and participants ====
actor User
participant ":Mitelovers" as System

User -> System : I want to Register an Item \nand add it to my library
activate System
System --> User : Display publication form
deactivate System


User -> System : publication form filled
activate System
System --> User : Display edition form
deactivate System

User -> System : edition form filled
activate System
System --> User: Display item form
deactivate System

User -> System : Item form filled
activate System
System --> User: successful registration


User -> System : add it to library
System --> User: Done!
deactivate System

@enduml